Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=8}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:40.66,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,你差點就踩到我們了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:43.37,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:47.80,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:51.59,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,你確實長大了…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.59,0:01:54.30,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我不會讓你帶走蘋果老頭的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:57.43,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,我希望你能…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:02:01.14,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,讓我好好完成我的工作，拜託。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.35,0:02:04.77,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,辦不到！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:19.83,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,哇，慢著…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:26.00,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:35.55,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,手下留情…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:39.89,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,可以的話！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.03,0:02:54.45,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,瞧他那勁頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:03:00.16,Main-207+,Nami,0,0,0,,趁還來得及，我們得快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:03.62,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,對，趁魯夫拖住黃猿的時候！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:06.62,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,搬羅賓的時候得小心點！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:11.05,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,你要去哪，阿特拉斯？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.05,0:03:14.51,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,我要下去奪回和平主義者的控制權！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:16.18,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,不然的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:18.22,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,一旦屏障消失…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:25.14,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,他們就會用雷射把我們轟飛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.14,0:03:26.94,Main-207+,Edison,0,0,0,,真是個好主意！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:29.73,Main-207+,Edison,0,0,0,,在這座島上，貝卡帕庫擁有最高權限！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:32.44,Main-207+,Edison,0,0,0,,而掌控和平主義者的人就贏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:36.03,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,沒錯！我走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.53,0:03:37.74,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,等等，阿特拉斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.66,0:03:40.74,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,呃，我的意思是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:42.99,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,我…我跟你一起去！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:43.62,Main-207+,Group,0,0,0,,－什麼？！\N－什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:46.21,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,你絕對不能去！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:47.04,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,為什麼不行？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:51.54,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,這一切都是因為他們想殺你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:52.63,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,是沒錯，可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.09,0:03:54.67,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,喂，佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.67,0:03:56.80,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,{\i1}佛朗基，你聽得到嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:57.63,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,聽得到！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:03:59.80,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,{\i1}波妮好像就在下面！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:02.18,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,她還活著？！這真是天大的好消息！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:05.06,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,黃猿狠狠踢了她一腳——正好踢進屏障裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:06.81,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,他{\i1}踢了{\i0}她？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.81,0:04:10.23,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,你好歹是個大男人吧？！\N怎麼能讓她被踢成那樣？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:11.69,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,我知道了啦！是我的錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:13.69,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,我現在就去救她！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.69,0:04:14.65,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,{\i1}最好是這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:16.78,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\i1}可是還有屏障擋著…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:20.53,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,就這麼定了！我也去！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.53,0:04:21.12,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:23.87,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,愛迪生可以解除屏障。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:29.21,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\i1}喂？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:32.71,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,我是香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:39.63,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,如果要去救波妮，算我一個！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:44.35,Main-207+,Jinbe,0,0,0,,貝卡帕庫，你說的那件行李我們拿到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.85,0:04:47.18,Main-207+,Jinbe,0,0,0,,{\i1}我往後方出口過去！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:48.98,Main-207+,Jinbe,0,0,0,,{\i1}大家在那裡會合吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.60,0:04:52.31,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,報告！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.15,0:04:56.40,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,我們全都被變成了小孩和老人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:58.11,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.11,0:05:01.11,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,別靠近鎮中心！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.11,0:05:03.95,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,我們認為海賊珠寶莉·波妮就在那裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:06.91,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,她一定藏在某處！保持警戒！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.91,0:05:09.29,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,她會操縱你們的年齡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:12.42,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,那個死小鬼跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:11.21,Secondary-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,太重了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:13.71,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,她一定就在附近！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.71,0:05:17.38,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,找出波妮，把她幹掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:20.51,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,可惡…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:21.97,Secondary-207+,Marine,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(960,100)}喂，這邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:24.89,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,找到戰桃丸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.43,0:05:26.68,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:30.10,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,他被燒得焦黑一片。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.85,0:05:32.40,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,戰桃丸…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:46.91,Flashbacks-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,戰…戰桃丸！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:48.79,Flashbacks-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,波妮…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.79,0:05:50.37,Flashbacks-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,快跑…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.75,0:05:53.12,Flashbacks-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,海軍要來了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.05,0:06:00.38,Flashbacks-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,戰桃丸！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:03.51,Thoughts-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,我該怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:04.26,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,她在那裡嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.26,0:06:05.05,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,報告，不在！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.05,0:06:05.97,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,去那邊查！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:06.85,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,是，長官！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:12.23,Thoughts-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,我能不能躲到這一切都平息為止？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.48,0:06:20.11,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你打得還真起勁！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:23.11,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,索隆！要幫忙嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.74,0:06:28.70,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你專心對付黃猿就好！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:47.43,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,如果你只有這點本事，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:52.39,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,就別想再有機會\N面對我們的船長。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:55.65,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,隨你怎麼說。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.65,0:06:58.02,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,你好歹是四皇的左右手。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:06:59.98,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,光是殺了你就很值得了。
Comment: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:18.92,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,I'm going to... fall into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.79,0:07:16.33,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,看來…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.92,0:07:18.92,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,我正朝著海面墜落。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:29.39,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}八尺瓊勾玉。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:51.49,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.08,0:07:57.00,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}－天叢雲劍。\N－天叢雲劍。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.27,0:08:20.15,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,好痛！超痛的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.15,0:08:21.61,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.73,0:08:25.65,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}黎明…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:28.74,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鞭！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:36.12,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,沒有用！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.12,0:08:37.25,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,難道是全息投影？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.25,0:08:39.33,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,哪一個才是真的？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.97,0:08:49.18,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,騙你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:50.63,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,上當了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.97,0:08:52.85,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.85,0:08:54.81,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}黎明…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:58.68,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}印章！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.11,0:09:13.20,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,這下真的也打中了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:23.92,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,被騙的{\i1}是我{\i0}才對啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:26.63,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,這就奇怪了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:30.26,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,貝卡帕庫跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.26,0:09:32.59,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,你能告訴我嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:35.30,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,魯…魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.53,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,蘋果老頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.95,0:09:54.74,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,等等！讓我上車，貝卡帕庫！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:57.16,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.16,0:09:58.58,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,你看起來很火大！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:01.46,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,你們這些爛海軍，最好別碰她！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:05.08,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,我來救你了，波妮！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:08.71,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,我怎能眼睜睜看著那個純真的孩子送命？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:10.30,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,純真的孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:12.17,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,快上車！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:15.34,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,我讓你搭我們的車！\N隨便找個地方擠進來就是！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:17.51,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,擠進來？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:28.90,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你在幹嘛？！給我待在實驗室裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:31.32,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你會沒命的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:36.32,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,你以為你要去哪…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:40.54,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,貝卡帕庫？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:43.04,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,糟了糟了糟了！我們得快走，史黛拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:05.06,Main-207+,Lilith,0,0,0,,他已經回來了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:07.77,Main-207+,Lilith,0,0,0,,史黛拉？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:09.02,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,莉莉絲！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.02,0:11:11.82,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,用佛朗基將軍把船搬走！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.48,0:11:14.40,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,我搭這班車，到那裡跟你們會合！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:15.91,Main-207+,Lilith,0,0,0,,交給我！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:45.23,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,愛迪生！就是現在！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:46.73,Main-207+,Edison,0,0,0,,馬上來！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.73,0:11:48.19,Main-207+,Edison,0,0,0,,前線巨蛋，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.19,0:11:50.06,Main-207+,Edison,0,0,0,,局部解除中！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:53.86,Main-207+,Edison,0,0,0,,開始重新啟動！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.53,0:11:58.99,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,我們在往下掉！在往下掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:11.75,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,喂…喂，快看！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.63,0:12:14.21,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,等一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:16.17,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,我…我就知道…那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:19.13,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,貝卡帕庫博士！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:23.43,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,這裡是島上的工廠層小組！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.43,0:12:24.72,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,我要報告！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.72,0:12:28.98,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,貝卡帕庫博士正從實驗層下來！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:31.36,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,準備攻擊！瞄準！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.45,0:12:42.20,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,全體和平主義者注意！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:46.79,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,貝卡帕庫對你們下達新命令！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.79,0:12:49.08,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,消滅這整座島上…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.13,0:12:55.13,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,所有的海軍！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.95,0:13:24.07,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,糟了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:25.74,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,這下輪到我們了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.79,0:13:28.66,Main-207+,Pacfista,0,0,0,,目標已更新。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.29,0:13:32.12,Main-207+,Pacfista,0,0,0,,消滅所有海軍。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.05,0:13:39.80,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,快離開和平主義者！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:52.44,Main-207+,Doberman,0,0,0,,一定是貝卡帕庫改寫了它們的命令！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:14:01.45,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,可惡！居然失去了和平主義者的控制權！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:04.91,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,可惡的貝卡帕庫！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:08.58,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,幹得好，和平主義者！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.33,0:14:12.96,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,繼續狠狠教訓他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:15.96,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,看來成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:16.88,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,聽得到！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:20.84,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.22,0:14:24.34,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,我們怎麼是直直往下開？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:25.93,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,不是應該會摔下去嗎？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.93,0:14:30.18,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,島雲有個特性，就是會彼此黏在一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:35.73,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,貝卡帕庫坦克的輪胎是用島雲做的，\N所以不會掉下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.11,0:14:39.19,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,別說這些了。阿特拉斯！定位波妮！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:42.19,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,她一定又孤單又害怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.19,0:14:43.82,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,波妮！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.82,0:14:46.70,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,你在哪？！波妮！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:48.12,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,波妮！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:50.62,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,波妮…！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.21,0:14:59.59,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,我必須集中精神！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:02.09,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,感受她的氣息！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.47,0:15:05.13,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,我必須為了波妮…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.43,0:15:07.76,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,傾注我全部的身心！
Comment: 0,0:15:03.47,0:15:07.76,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Give her my whole heart and soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:20.82,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,我的淑女雷達有反應了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:22.03,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,我找到她了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:24.03,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,她在哪？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.03,0:15:26.03,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,我只看到海軍！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.03,0:15:28.53,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,你確定嗎，香吉士？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:31.29,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,我的雷達什麼時候出過錯？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.29,0:15:33.16,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,這個嘛，是沒有…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.16,0:15:37.67,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,管它科不科學…我就是信你！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.67,0:15:39.04,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,多謝了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.67,0:15:41.38,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,不過，這輛坦克啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:44.84,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,慢得跟不上我這顆焦急的心！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:50.85,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,我馬上就到，波妮！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:54.31,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,太好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.93,0:15:57.19,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,和平主義者又站到我們這邊了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:10.16,Main-207+,Pomsky,0,0,0,,終於找到你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:13.24,Main-207+,Pomsky,0,0,0,,海賊…珠寶莉·波妮！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.24,0:16:15.62,Main-207+,Pomsky,0,0,0,,你竟敢對我的部下下這種手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.87,0:16:18.62,Main-207+,Pomsky,0,0,0,,找到她了！她在這邊！
Comment: 0,0:16:26.47,0:16:28.43,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}N.D.E!
Comment: 0,0:16:26.47,0:16:28.43,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,{\fs41\fad(150,150)}Near-Death Experience!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.47,0:16:28.43,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}瀕死體驗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:58.62,Main-207+,Pomsky,0,0,0,,喂！你們是怎麼了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:17:01.71,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,我看見三途川了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:05.80,Main-207+,Pomsky,0,0,0,,給我回來，波妮！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.93,0:17:11.30,Main-207+,Pacfista,0,0,0,,你逃不掉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.93,0:17:14.76,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:17.02,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,為什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:22.90,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,雖然只有一台，但不管權限階級怎麼規定，\N我都能控制它！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:27.03,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,只要是我搭上的東西，我都能指揮！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.03,0:17:29.86,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,我可是吃了乘乘果實的女駕駛！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:35.08,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,只要殺了你，你對我部下下的詛咒\N就會解除嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.00,0:17:42.83,Thoughts-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.83,0:17:47.05,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,把他們的年齡變回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.35,0:17:58.56,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,波妮，你要專心啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:02.14,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,黑腳！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.89,0:18:05.86,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,我聽說熊是你的父親。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:12.86,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,但你要記住，那些不是他！否則你…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.57,0:18:18.08,Main-207+,Pomsky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}水獺鐵鎚！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.83,0:18:22.62,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,他們沒完沒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.21,0:18:26.59,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,看來我們該逃了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.59,0:18:30.09,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,別讓他們跑了，和平主義者！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.80,0:18:33.26,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.64,0:18:41.68,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,波妮！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:46.86,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,香吉士、波妮！快上車！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.44,0:18:51.94,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,和平主義者現在站在我們這邊了！\N我們回上面去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:54.07,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,快把它甩開啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.07,0:18:56.32,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.36,0:19:31.65,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,我們這麼做，也是有我們的理由的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:36.66,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我才不管！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:51.63,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,抱歉，但要是把時間全耗在你身上，\N我就無法完成任務了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:19:58.26,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,這正是我要的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.43,0:20:02.06,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\i1}我的{\i0}任務就是拖住你的時間！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:08.48,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,該怎麼辦…？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:13.11,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,慢著！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.37,0:20:27.87,Main-207+,Nami,0,0,0,,怎麼了，喬巴？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:29.75,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.75,0:20:31.71,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,我也說不上來，可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.71,0:20:35.17,Main-207+,Jinbe,0,0,0,,這股陰森的氣息是什麼？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.77,0:20:54.73,Main-207+,Doberman,0,0,0,,這到底是什麼…？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:59.07,Main-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,退下，和平主義者。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.91,0:21:09.08,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:12.13,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,和平主義者停止護送我們了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.13,0:21:13.88,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,拜託啊，和平主義者！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:15.84,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,你們應該要保護我們的啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:18.26,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,我下了命令的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.01,0:21:21.01,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,這到底是怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:26.43,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,在權限階級中，唯一凌駕我們之上的…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.85,0:21:28.06,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.98,0:21:30.85,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,五老星！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.23,0:21:35.40,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,我們被攻擊了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:48.50,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,是召喚陣？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.38,0:22:00.55,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,搞什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.55,0:22:03.05,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,不對勁！我們得往高處去！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.05,0:22:03.76,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.64,0:22:09.35,Main-207+,Doberman,0,0,0,,陸地上所有海軍注意！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.72,0:22:14.81,Main-207+,Doberman,0,0,0,,五老星的薩圖恩聖\N即將登陸蛋頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.31,0:22:19.53,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,准將以下者，一律不得瞻仰他的尊容！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.78,0:22:21.99,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,五老星之一？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.99,0:22:23.45,Main-207+,Doberman,0,0,0,,{\i1}重複一遍！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.45,0:22:28.03,Main-207+,Doberman,0,0,0,,{\i1}五老星的薩圖恩聖\N即將登陸蛋頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.83,0:22:38.25,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,那爆炸到底是怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.84,0:22:42.59,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,五老星？！他們竟然有人\N親自來到島上？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.59,0:22:43.97,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,「五老星」？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.97,0:22:45.64,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,他們到底是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.64,0:22:47.68,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,是這世上最高的權威！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.68,0:22:49.10,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.95,0:23:13.33,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,有東西冒出來了…！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.73,0:23:40.98,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,那{\i1}是{\i0}什麼東西？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:42.48,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,是怪物…！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.48,0:23:43.40,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,別亂說話！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.74,0:23:45.32,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,一定是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.12,0:23:55.87,Main-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,地表啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.46,0:23:59.29,Main-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,好久沒來了…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.26,0:24:06.47,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,那是某種怪物嗎？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.64,0:24:09.64,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,抬頭看！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.64,0:24:10.60,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,快轉向！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.27,0:24:16.48,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,哎呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.48,0:24:18.69,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,好險…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.69,0:24:20.90,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,糟了！島雲…！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.61,0:24:25.03,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,黃猿！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.28,0:24:31.99,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,站住，黃猿！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.53,0:24:36.91,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,你維持那個形態\N應該也快到極限了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.91,0:24:38.92,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,拜託了，魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.92,0:24:42.92,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,想想辦法！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.63,0:24:50.47,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,交給我—
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.31,0:25:00.77,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.69,0:25:05.73,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}星光…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.44,0:25:07.15,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,75)}槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.08,0:25:24.17,Thoughts-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,哎呀…這下不妙。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.88,0:25:31.34,Main-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,尼卡…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.69,0:25:42.48,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,時間到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.37,0:25:57.70,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,你沒事吧，貝卡帕庫？！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.70,0:25:59.70,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,別擔心，我沒事。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.70,0:26:01.71,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯，你受傷了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.71,0:26:02.67,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,我沒事！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.71,0:26:11.42,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,你是薩圖恩聖嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.42,0:26:12.97,Main-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,正是。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.43,0:26:19.89,Main-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,我還以為我們早就把你殺了，貝卡帕庫。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.23,0:26:30.69,Flashbacks-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,我給過你命令，貝卡帕庫。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.20,0:26:41.25,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,波妮！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.88,0:26:51.26,Flashbacks-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,不准留給他一絲一毫的自由意志！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.26,0:26:54.55,Flashbacks-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,可是那樣的話，熊他…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.55,0:26:58.51,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,薩圖恩聖！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=9}===============================DIALOGUE============================
